    "turn_text": "than he is of America. And America first America First doesn't just mean you get inside your borders, which means whatever he wants it to mean, just like he says he's a nationalist, he knows what that means. To put America First, you've got to have us protect our interests and our citizens around the globe, and that involves maintaining our alliances with the NATO countries and defending the Baltic countries who are under threat from Russia and Ukraine, who's under constant threat in the eastern provinces, which have the Russians have peeled off. We need to maintain its relationships and we need to be supportive of the Kurds who are friends in Iraq. In Iraq and all those days it was the Kurds who could effectively fight and maintain their area and we're honest. The Kurds have been our friends and they're going to be slaughtered and the blood is going to be in our hands. Just as well as Khashoggi's blood is on the Saudi princess hands and on trumps for being a hater and a better.",
